# Add project-specific packages for Buildroot here
#
# If these are non-proprietary, please consider contributing them back to
# Nerves or Buildroot.
#
# ab_ops/ufs_boot_lun are NOT sourced from here (or from
# nerves_system_sheng/Config.in) - deeper than a Config.in sourcing
# ambiguity, Buildroot's actual *.mk package discovery (separate from
# Kconfig symbol sourcing) only ever scans BR2_EXTERNAL_DIRS, and the
# Docker build_runner's generated .br2-external.mk registers ONLY
# /nerves/env/platform (deps/nerves_system_br) as external tree "NERVES" -
# nerves_system_sheng's own package/ is never scanned for *.mk at all,
# confirmed via the generated .br2-external.mk directly. A Config.in-only
# sourcing trick (tried here first) got the Kconfig symbol recognized but
# never actually built - zero trace in a full build log. Real fix: these
# two packages' Config.in/.mk/src are duplicated into
# deps/nerves_system_br/package/{ab_ops,ufs_boot_lun}/ (both the root
# app's copy and this nested one), sourced from deps/nerves_system_br/
# Config.in instead. Keep both copies in sync by hand if either changes -
# not ideal, but deps/nerves_system_br isn't something this project
# controls the discovery mechanism for.
